and the ring’s positioning in modern debates over gemmae dubitandae and relational archaeology, with non-Wikipedia 
sources (Hudler’s PDF) directly cited. This partially satisfies the requirement that discovery/provenance, dating 
context (as an alleged Aegean Bronze Age object), and scholarly interpretation be documented with non-Wikipedia 
references. However, no full article has yet been synthesized; the material is fragmentary and does not constitute a 
