"“Eliopoulos, Theodore. ‘SOME OBSERVATIONS ON THE ICONOGRAPHY OF THE ‘RING OF NESTOR.’’ ANNUARIO Della Scuola 
Archeologica Di Atene e Delle Missioni Italiane in Oriente, vol. XCI, 2013, pp. 209–228.”", "source_ids": 
["20260719003933769555_a2004ad2"], "citations": [6], "sources": [{"source_id": "20260719003933769555_a2004ad2", 
